			"notes": "## 🚀 Placement Helper v1.0.0 (Multi-Version Support)\n\nThis release adds support for both **Minecraft 1.21.8** and **1.21.11**. Choose the appropriate `.jar` file below for your version.\n\n### 🛠 What it does\n\nPlacement Helper removes the internal 4-tick delay when placing blocks. This makes building much more responsive and fluid, especially for creative projects and large-scale builds.\n\n### ✨ Key Features\n\n* **No Place Cooldown:** Place blocks as fast as you can click.\n* **Toggleable:** Press **[R]** ingame to enable or disable the mod on the fly.\n* **Client-Side Only:** This mod does not need to be installed on the server.\n\n### 📦 Installation\n\n1. Make sure you have the latest **Fabric Loader** installed.\n2. Download the `.jar` that matches your Minecraft version (1.21.8 or 1.21.11).\n3. Place it in your `mods` folder.\n\n---\n\n⚠️ **Multiplayer Disclaimer:**\nThis mod adjusts client-side behavior. Always check the rules of your multiplayer server before using it. Use it responsibly, preferably in Singleplayer or Creative environments."
